WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
A fixed brass projection reaches into the opening.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.417
The first bit reaches the entrance ward. It cannot slide any farther in.

00:00:03.417 --> 00:00:04.583
The faceplate and the ward stay in place as the key comes out.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.792
A slot down the second bit leaves a path for the projection.

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:07.458
The bit is through the plate. A lock can still have more wards farther inside.

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.083
The slotted bit turns behind the ward until it reaches the projection on the bolt.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:09.500
The bit pushes the talon and the steel bolt slides through its guides.
